Engineering Automation Case Study
Use Case: Automated Telecom Network Monitoring & Alerting System
Industry Scenario

A telecom company operates thousands of network towers across multiple cities.

Every tower continuously generates:

CPU utilization logs
Network traffic logs
Signal strength metrics
Hardware temperature alerts
Service outage alarms

Previously, engineers manually checked logs and dashboards, causing:

Delayed incident detection
Missed outages
Long downtime
Poor customer experience

The company decides to build an automated monitoring and alerting system using Python.
